	<text xml:lang="de">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Den artickel, wie ich üch geschriben, diewyl <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>alle schidort biß an <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, das sich der sach <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nüt beladen wöllen, den <placeName ref="l646">Glarnern</placeName> geradten, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>habend sy angenommen mitt heyterer protestation, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>by ir religion zuͦ blyben; dann sy daa <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gar redlich xin.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="de">Die schidort habend sy <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ouch gnuͦgsam versorgt und sich och die <placeName ref="l894">4 Ort</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>uffgethan.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="de">Ist der frid also angenommen von <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l300">Lucern</placeName>, <placeName ref="l781">Ury</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2469">Underwalden</placeName>, <placeName ref="l801">Zug</placeName> und <placeName ref="l646">Glarus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Zuͦ stund hat man sy widerumb yngesetzt und <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ist aman <persName ref="p8440">Schuͦler</persName> zum ersten imm radt gesässen.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Der bott von <placeName ref="l2450">Schwyz</placeName> ist drusgangen, ist <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>übel zuͦfriden xin; dann sin meinung ist, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l646">Glaris</placeName> sölle one fürwort das chuͦnzilium <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>annemmen.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Das wil <placeName ref="l646">Glaris</placeName> schlächt nitt etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Z<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ürych</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>, <placeName ref="l300">Lucern</placeName>, <placeName ref="l801">Zug</placeName> habend die <placeName ref="l2450">Schwyte<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>r</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>by den <placeName ref="l648">pündten</placeName> gemanet, ruͤwig zuͦ sin, und <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>den lantvogt <persName ref="p5698">Luchsinger</persName> lassen uffryten.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Was <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sy thuͦn, söllend sy gen <placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName> schryben, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>daruff wyter gehandlet werden.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Gott gäb alles <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>guͦts.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l646">Glarner</placeName> warend frölich, alls sy <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>hie durch heym rittend, und ist kein <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>wunder; dann sy lang gnuͦg plaget sind.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Wölle <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>gott, das deren von <placeName ref="l2450">Schwyz</placeName> halb ouch an ein end kumme.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Ex <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> scribit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>am<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>icus fore brevi obsidendam; moneri enim <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>eos <persName>Allobrogem</persName> principem sessores clanculo conduxis<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>se, qui cum exercitu, qui in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>conscriptus est, de repente irruant et munitio<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nes intra biduum et triduum suffodiant urbemque <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>capiant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ideo se 600 conduxisse milites, a <placeName ref="l41">Bernatibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>petere 300.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> renuisse, quod <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>haec incerta sint et nolint principium dare <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>bello.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scribit idem in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> rursus spe <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>plenos impios moliri nescio quid.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>vivit dominus exercituum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gott Zebaoth (vgl. <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> <hi>Eißfeldt,</hi> in: RGG VI 1875f).</note>, qui nobis orandus <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>est, ut servet nos.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Foedus petitum a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Nihil responsum,</foreign> er fertige dann alle ansprachen <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ab etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Plura non possum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>amicos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quam excruciat me libidinosa illa ac <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>spurca ministrorum vita.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Ey<note type="misc">Eij?</note> lassend es den luren <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>werden, setzend s'näben die diensten, 7. iulii 1564.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Tuus qui semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantiss. viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curien</placeName>. <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>eccliae fideli ministro, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino colendo et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>chariss. meo.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
